WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.117
This model follows one real, published case.

00:00:03.467 --> 00:00:06.568
A woman aged 72 had a cancer on her right lower gum,

00:00:06.568 --> 00:00:08.417
and it had grown into the bone.

00:00:09.217 --> 00:00:12.543
Surgeons took out the right side of her lower jaw in one piece,

00:00:12.543 --> 00:00:13.441
with its 8 teeth.

00:00:14.241 --> 00:00:15.777
This left a large gap.

00:00:16.577 --> 00:00:19.265
They rebuilt the jaw with bone from her leg (fibula).

00:00:19.615 --> 00:00:24.095
Surgeons join its blood vessels to vessels in the neck, so the bone stays alive.

00:00:24.895 --> 00:00:27.391
Nine months later the new bone had taken well.

00:00:27.741 --> 00:00:31.218
If you have had mouth cancer, you need regular checks for many years.
